WEBVTT

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.220
What's this?

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:07.950
The Seal of Orichalcos.

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:14.960
Once you're trapped in this seal, you can't escape unless you win the duel.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:20.570
And the Seal will seal away the loser's soul.

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:21.670
What?

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.240
Stop joking!

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:24.890
Big brother!

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:28.020
Mokuba!

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:48.070
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:55.210
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:55.990 --> 00:01:01.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:07.860
I was searching for your smile

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:15.230
With our memories fading

00:01:15.770 --> 00:01:22.310
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:29.210
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:36.440
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:56.260 --> 00:02:02.270
Awaken!  Critias

00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:07.700
Big brother!

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:11.780
You put a lot of effort into this trick.

00:02:12.130 --> 00:02:17.680
Seto Kaiba, I've waited a long time for this day.

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:20.150
Amelda, is it?

00:02:20.150 --> 00:02:26.830
Did you cause the Duel Monsters phenomenon and buy up Kaiba Corporation's stock?

00:02:27.060 --> 00:02:28.210
Who knows.

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:32.330
What's this farce for?

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:36.440
I told you.  To take your soul.

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:39.440
Enough with your nonsense!

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:42.190
Nonsense?

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:48.180
Whatever.  You'll never leave The Seal of Orichalcos.

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:53.790
You'll pay for your and Kaiba Corporation's crimes with your soul!

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:57.790
Crimes?  What are you talking about?

00:03:08.860 --> 00:03:10.800
What's wrong, Yugi?

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:14.540
I'm worried about Pegasus.

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:16.040
Worried?

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:22.150
He said someone was watching him in his video message.

00:03:22.150 --> 00:03:23.050
Yeah.

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:28.550
If that's true, Pegasus may be in danger.

00:03:28.780 --> 00:03:29.900
Danger?

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:37.530
I summon Gorlag in attack position.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:49.880
Its attack points went up.  Why?

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:57.880
The Seal of Orichalcos raises all my monsters' attack points by 500.

00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:58.950
What?

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:06.460
And Gorlag gains 500 attack points for every Fire Attribute monster on the field.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:08.030
And...

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:11.290
Gorlag itself is Fire Attribute!

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:16.900
2000 attack points.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:20.560
Gorlag, attack Versago the Destroyer!

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:32.250
When Gorlag destroys a monster...

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:38.710
...it's Special Summoned to my field in attack position at the end of the Battle Phase.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:41.140
As a Fire Attribute monster.

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:43.660
But it loses its effects.

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:56.290
With another Fire Attribute monster, Gorlag gains more attack points.

00:04:58.160 --> 00:05:04.750
Damn.  Whenever my brother's monster is destroyed, the opponent's field gets stronger.

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:10.360
I set a card and end my turn.

00:05:11.320 --> 00:05:14.310
His Gorlag strategy has no weaknesses.

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:16.600
He's more than just talk.

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:19.250
But...

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:26.940
If I destroy Gorlag, I can get rid of his Special Summoned monster.

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:30.570
I'll use my virus combo to get him next turn.

00:05:30.570 --> 00:05:31.680
My turn!

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:33.320
I draw!

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:38.530
I summon Pitch-Dark Dragon in defense position!

00:05:40.760 --> 00:05:43.950
And I set a card!

00:05:44.810 --> 00:05:46.990
Is that Crush Card Virus?

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:50.910
I know your plans.

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:56.470
Because I analyzed everything about you.

00:05:56.700 --> 00:06:01.740
I see.  You thoroughly prepared yourself.

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:08.350
Because you must try hard to ignorantly challenge someone as powerful as me.

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:10.350
You're the one who's ignorant!

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:11.360
What?

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:18.860
Look at this.

00:06:21.820 --> 00:06:24.100
Who cares about that piece of junk?

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:28.100
So it looks like junk to you.

00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:30.700
If not, what is it?

00:06:31.770 --> 00:06:34.400
This is my...

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:37.440
This belonged to my brother!

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:41.330
Due to you, my brother...

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:43.920
Your company killed him!

00:06:46.890 --> 00:06:49.300
My country used to be beautiful.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:54.660
I still remember how my city hadn't changed for hundreds of years.

00:06:55.740 --> 00:06:59.360
But then I saw hell.

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:19.850
Watch out!

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:25.490
You still have that?

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:30.720
It's the first thing you ever got me for my birthday.

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:32.500
It's my prized possession!

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:37.500
When the war's over, I'll buy as many of those as you want.

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:42.010
Really?  I hope the war ends soon.

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:45.020
It'll end eventually.

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:50.020
Then we can play soccer again?

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:51.750
Yeah.

00:07:58.060 --> 00:07:59.630
Now!  Let's go!

00:08:26.410 --> 00:08:27.990
Are you boys okay?

00:08:32.260 --> 00:08:34.030
So cool!

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:36.360
Wow!  Brand new tanks!

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:39.050
It's Kaiba Corporation's newest model.

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:41.600
They're superior to the enemy's tanks.

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:45.600
Kaiba Corporation is helping us!

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:48.170
We can get as many weapons as we want!

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:50.210
We can win!

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:53.210
They'll end the war!

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:54.210
Yeah!

00:08:54.210 --> 00:08:55.760
Wait up!

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:57.220
Hurry!

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:01.650
Mama...

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:04.000
Brother, are you crying?

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:05.370
No!

00:09:06.740 --> 00:09:09.230
But your stomach is growling.

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:11.230
I'll bring food.

00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:15.600
Brother!

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:17.530
Come on, Mirko!

00:09:22.090 --> 00:09:24.240
Get in!  It's safe in here!

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:25.240
Right!

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:29.400
Mama's pendant!

00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:30.420
Wait here!

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:38.090
Mirko!

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:22.190
Mirko...

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:34.960
Mirko!

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:53.260
Do you know who he is?

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:04.740
Gozaburo Kaiba, president of Kaiba Corporation.

00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:07.980
Kaiba Corporation...

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:12.980
Yes.  He's the real enemy who killed your brother.

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:18.720
To test his new weapons in actual warfare, he supplied weapons to both sides.

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:20.230
No way!

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:26.230
Do you want to get revenge?

00:11:48.820 --> 00:11:50.140
No way...

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:55.730
My heart died then.  This is revenge.

00:11:57.950 --> 00:12:01.840
It's not my brother's fault!

00:12:02.230 --> 00:12:02.970
Mokuba.

00:12:02.970 --> 00:12:05.510
Gozaburo sold the weapons!

00:12:05.510 --> 00:12:07.600
My brother hated that!

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:14.980
That's why he took over Kaiba Corporation and using its technology to build a better future!

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:19.350
That's how my brother and Kaiba Corporation will atone for the past!

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:21.090
Atone?

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:26.590
That's right!  My brother will build Kaiba Lands for kids worldwide!

00:12:26.590 --> 00:12:28.220
Don't make me laugh!

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:32.100
Will that bring my brother and my parents back?

00:12:32.740 --> 00:12:34.370
W-Well...

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:36.600
That's enough, Mokuba.

00:12:36.820 --> 00:12:38.480
But big brother...

00:12:40.510 --> 00:12:45.160
Kaiba Corporation fattened up by destroying peace.

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:50.350
The immense funds needed to develop your Duel Disk-

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:51.660
Actually...

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:56.590
The food you eat to live, the clothes you wear...

00:12:56.590 --> 00:13:00.090
You bought it all using Kaiba Corporation's money!

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:03.090
The money you earned by killing people!

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:07.830
You will pay with your soul!

00:13:08.170 --> 00:13:09.910
Revenge, huh?

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:16.260
When I took over Kaiba Corporation, I also inherited Gozaburo's sins.

00:13:16.260 --> 00:13:19.450
I won't deny that.  However...

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:24.880
Since you challenged me, speak to me through your dueling!

00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:30.190
Whether I win or lose this duel will decide if my path is correct!

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:32.660
I'm the one who's right.

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:34.170
You can't win.

00:13:34.170 --> 00:13:38.430
I activate the trap card, Royal Decree.

00:13:38.430 --> 00:13:43.720
As long as I have this card, all trap cards on the field are negated!

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:46.640
Trap cards are negated?

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:50.880
Your Crush Card Virus is now worthless.

00:13:51.860 --> 00:13:53.380
I end my turn.

00:13:53.660 --> 00:13:54.950
My turn!

00:13:55.210 --> 00:13:58.120
Gorlag attacks Pitch-Dark Dragon!

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:05.590
You now have no monsters to protect you.

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:09.330
Versago the Destroyer attacks you directly!

00:14:15.340 --> 00:14:17.300
My brother's life points!

00:14:17.520 --> 00:14:22.020
By destroying Pitch-Dark Dragon, it belongs to me.

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:30.980
I have no monsters in my hand that I can summon without tributing.

00:14:30.980 --> 00:14:34.050
Everything depends on my next turn's draw.

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:35.790
My turn!

00:14:37.800 --> 00:14:38.660
Good!

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:43.800
I determine my own future!

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:47.160
I activate the spell card, Card of Demise!

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:50.000
I'll now have five cards in my hand!

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:53.710
Witness the power to determine my own future!

00:14:53.970 --> 00:14:56.900
I activate the Ritual Spell, White Dragon Ritual!

00:14:57.600 --> 00:15:03.080
By tributing a Level 4-or-higher monster, I bring Paladin of White Dragon!

00:15:03.080 --> 00:15:03.810
What?

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:08.320
I tribute Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:13.040
I Ritual Summon Paladin of White Dragon!

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:19.060
Then I use Monster Reborn to Special Summon Blue-Eyes from my graveyard!

00:15:22.710 --> 00:15:27.140
Paladin of White Dragon attacks Pitch-Dark Dragon!

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:35.650
Gorlag's effect lost one Fire Attribute monster.

00:15:37.530 --> 00:15:40.290
Blue-Eyes attacks Gorlag!

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:53.450
By tributing Paladin of White Dragon...

00:15:53.450 --> 00:16:00.620
...I can Special Summon a Blue-Eyes White Dragon from my hand or deck.

00:16:02.820 --> 00:16:05.820
You said I couldn't win.

00:16:05.820 --> 00:16:08.550
But I can say that about you!

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:10.060
My turn!

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:15.530
That was a splendid attack, Seto Kaiba.

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:19.130
But a candle burns bright before it's extinguished.

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:21.530
Still babbling on?

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:26.770
I activate my spell card, Pot of Greed.

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:29.270
I draw two cards from my deck.

00:16:29.270 --> 00:16:33.850
I activate the spell card, Aetonyx Flame!

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:40.680
Impossible!  Both my Blue-Eyes!

00:16:40.980 --> 00:16:49.050
Aetonyx Flame destroys all non-Fiend, non-Fire Attribute monsters on the field.

00:16:49.050 --> 00:16:54.190
And I can Special Summon a Fiend-Type Fire Attribute monster from my graveyard.

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:05.240
I activate the spell card, Fire Whip!

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:20.990
Fire Whip Special Summons all monsters destroyed this turn as Fire Attribute monsters.

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:22.990
My Blue-Eyes...

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:27.890
Your most trusted Blue-Eyes will finish you.

00:17:28.490 --> 00:17:31.500
There's no better ending for you.

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:45.540
Since the two Blue-Eyes are Fire Attribute, they strengthen Gorlag.

00:17:48.220 --> 00:17:54.040
Due to Aetonyx Flame's effect, I'm not allowed to battle this turn.

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:55.880
How lucky for you.

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:58.820
I set a card and end my turn.

00:18:01.410 --> 00:18:04.720
Draw a card, Seto Kaiba.

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:07.330
It's the final draw of your life!

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:13.340
Without a God Card, I have no card to turn this duel around.

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:16.880
Am I actually going to lose?

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:20.200
I can't allow that!

00:18:30.240 --> 00:18:31.720
Where am I?

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:40.400
What's this statue?

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:43.900
Am I supposed to remove that?

00:18:58.640 --> 00:19:02.420
Why do I know your name?

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:05.930
Your name is Critias!

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:13.200
What's this?

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:14.770
What's up?

00:19:22.880 --> 00:19:24.780
Was I hallucinating?

00:19:28.940 --> 00:19:30.800
What's this card?

00:19:32.510 --> 00:19:36.680
No way!  Why do I have an unknown card in my deck?

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:42.030
But I know the power this card holds.

00:19:42.300 --> 00:19:43.720
It's the key to victory!

00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:45.460
I bet it all on this card!

00:19:46.480 --> 00:19:48.530
Go!  Fang of Critias!

00:19:48.530 --> 00:19:50.770
What's that card?

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:56.510
Its effect fuses it with a trap card to summon a Fusion Monster!

00:19:59.150 --> 00:20:03.010
No way!  A monster that fuses with a trap card?

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:06.720
I transcend what can be done!

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:12.010
Come out!  Doom Virus Dragon!

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:16.530
Doom Virus Dragon?

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:24.630
Doom Virus Dragon destroys all monsters with 1500 or more attack points!

00:20:32.110 --> 00:20:35.880
Take this!  Doom Virus Dragon attacks you directly!

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:41.250
I win, Amelda!

00:20:41.950 --> 00:20:44.290
I activate my set card!

00:20:44.290 --> 00:20:46.990
The Quick-Play Spell, Contagion of Madness!

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:47.990
What?

00:20:53.280 --> 00:20:54.960
Due to Contagion of Madness...

00:20:54.960 --> 00:21:03.110
...you take damage equal to half what I took in the monster battle.

00:21:13.980 --> 00:21:14.850
Big brother!

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:17.660
A tie?

00:21:18.100 --> 00:21:23.160
Remember this!  I promise to get my revenge!

00:21:36.590 --> 00:21:38.370
Out of gas?

00:21:38.370 --> 00:21:39.380
Huh?  Hey!

00:21:43.100 --> 00:21:44.340
What's going on?

00:21:58.540 --> 00:22:07.450
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:15.790
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:17.520 --> 00:22:26.950
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:27.570 --> 00:22:36.470
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:45.500
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:46.280 --> 00:22:51.010
I'll live feeling them

00:22:51.620 --> 00:22:56.190
For me to be me

00:22:56.190 --> 00:23:04.650
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:05.330 --> 00:23:10.290
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:10.810 --> 00:23:19.950
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:27.520 --> 00:23:30.790
While Kaiba fought Doma's Amelda...

00:23:30.790 --> 00:23:36.590
...our limousine headed towards Pegasus's Industrial Illusions.

00:23:36.590 --> 00:23:42.650
But we stop at an old gasoline stand, and the driver doesn't return.

00:23:42.650 --> 00:23:45.150
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:23:45.150 --> 00:23:49.840
What?  A biker gang is headed this way!

00:23:49.840 --> 00:23:51.940
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Unexpected Enemy

00:23:51.940 --> 00:23:53.300
Duel, standby!
